=> END

~ location
{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: My location is {{GlobalVars.loc_name}} in the {{GlobalVars.loc_section}} section, at the {{GlobalVars.loc_description}}
=> END

~ outofmoves
set GlobalVars.dialogue_active = true
{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Sorry, boss. I'm stuck here. I'm afraid you'll have to go on without me.
Dispatcher: Agent {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}} is unable to move and thus out of the game.
set GlobalVars.dialogue_active = false
do GlobalVars.out_of_moves_check.emit()
=> END

~ special
match GlobalVars.player_focus_name
	when "Bertha"
		Bertha: Do you want me to use my psychic abilities to sense the stress level of the suspect?
		- [[Go for it.|Yes, do it.|Make it so.|Absolutely.]]
			do GlobalVars.use_special.emit()
			Bertha: Okay, here goes ... [wave]mmmmmmmmm[/wave] ... I sense {{GlobalVars.sus_name}} is {{GlobalVars.sus_duress_level}}. I hope that helps.
		- No, never mind.
	when "Cristobal"
		Cristobal: Do you want me to plant a listening device at location {{GlobalVars.agent_location[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}? It will detect if the suspect can reach this location in one move.
		- [[Go for it.|Yes, do it.|Make it so.|Absolutely.]]
			set GlobalVars.listening_device.append(GlobalVars.agent_location[GlobalVars.player_focus])
			#set GlobalVars.listening_device.append(98) # FOR TESTING
			do GlobalVars.use_special.emit()
			Cristobal: The device is set and in position.
		- No, never mind.
	when "Dolly"
		Dolly: Do you want me to establish a blockade at this location? It will prevent the suspect from entering here.
		- [[Go for it.|Yes, do it.|Make it so.|Absolutely.]]
			set GlobalVars.blocked_location.append(GlobalVars.agent_location[GlobalVars.player_focus])
			#set GlobalVars.blocked_location.append(99) # FOR TESTING
			do GlobalVars.blockade.emit()
			Dolly: Location {{GlobalVars.agent_location[GlobalVars.player_focus]}} is now blocked.
		- No, never mind.
	when "Edouard"
		Edouard: Do you want me to use my psychic abilities to sense which agent is closest to the suspect?
		- [[Go for it.|Yes, do it.|Make it so.|Absolutely.]]
			do GlobalVars.use_special.emit()
			if GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.closest_agent] == "Edouard"
				Edouard: Okay, here goes ... [wave]mmmmmmmmm[/wave] ... I sense I am the closest agent to {{GlobalVars.sus_name}}.
			else
				Edouard: Okay, here goes ... [wave]mmmmmmmmm[/wave] ... I sense {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.closest_agent]}} the closest agent to {{GlobalVars.sus_name}}.
			if GlobalVars.closest_distance < 500
				Edouard: And I believe it's quite close.
		- No, never mind.
	when "Hanna"
		Hanna: Do you want me to check with one of my informants to see if we can get a possible location for the suspect?
		- [[Go for it.|Yes, do it.|Make it so.|Absolutely.]]
			do GlobalVars.use_special.emit()
			do GlobalVars._sus_section_informant()
			Hanna: Ok, let me check, hold on ...
			Hanna: [i]Hi, it's me. Can you talk?[/i]
			
			% Hanna: [i]Yes, everyone's doing well, thanks. Listen, I ...[/i]
			% Hanna: [i]I know it's been a while, but I need a favor.[/i]
			% Hanna: [i]No, it's not about that. I need your ...[/i]
			
			% Hanna: [i]Thanks, I appreciate that, but ...[/i]
			% Hanna: [i]Look, I haven't forgotten. I've been busy. Right now I need ...[/i]
			% Hanna: [i]I know, we need to get together ...[/i]
			
			Hanna: [i]Please, I don't have a lot of time. Do you know where I can find {{GlobalVars.sus_name}}?[/i]
			Hanna: [i]Uh huh ... okay ... How sure are you?[/i]
			Hanna: [i]Great. Thanks, buddy. I owe you one.[/i]
			Hanna: I'm back. My informant says the suspect is somewhere in the {{GlobalVars.sus_section_response}} section of town. I would say that, while not one hundred percent certain, this information is very trustworthy.
		- No, never mind.
		
=> END

~ listening_device
Cristobal: Hey! My listening device at location {{GlobalVars.sus_location[0]}} has detected that the suspect is within range of that device.
=> END

~ wild_animal_nervous
% {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: There's a bear in this section of town, right? No problem; I'm trained to handle this. ... [shake rate=20 level=10]I can handle this.[/shake]
%
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: There's a bear around here? Great, bring it on! Here, bear! Come and get me.
	Dispatcher: Agent {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}, bears are no joke. Handle bear encounters professionally.
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: You're right, sorry.
% {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: I understand there's a bear spotted in this part of town. I'll be careful.
%
	if  GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus] != "Arthur"
		{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: I'm not afraid of a big, hairy animal. Have you seen Arthur without a shirt on? I can handle that.
		Arthur: I heard that!
		{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Just messin' with you, buddy.
=> END

~ wild_animal_encounter
%
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: There is a bear at this location, but he has wandered off.
	Dispatcher: Noted. Thanks.
%
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Um ... uh ... There's a bear staring right at me.
	Dispatcher: Stay, calm. Remember your training.
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Right. ... Okay, it's moved away. Thanks.
%
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Oh, look. A bear! Not to worry, it's wandering away.
	Dispatcher: Thanks for letting me know.
=> END

~ wild_animal_at_location_choice
% {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: You want me to go there? But there's a bear there. I can see it.
% {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Are you sure? There's black bear at that location.

Dispatcher: Yes, that was your assignment, agent {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}. Is there a problem?
{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Can I just wait for the bear to move away?
- Sure, wait for the bear to move.
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Great. Thanks.
	Dispatcher: While you're waiting, brush up on your training for bear encounters.
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Will do.
	do GlobalVars.skip_turn_wild_animal.emit()
- Proceed to that location. You've had your training - use it.
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: [[I understand.|Right, got it.]] Here I go. It's moving away now.
	do GlobalVars.no_skip_turn_wild_animal.emit()
=> END

~ wild_animal_at_location_choice_again
% {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: You want me to go there? But there's a bear there. I can see it.
% {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Are you sure? There's black bear at that location.

Dispatcher: Yes, that was your assignment, agent {{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}. We already went over this. What's the problem, now?

%
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: I know, but this bear is looking at me funny.
	Dispatcher: What does that even mean?
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: It mean ... I dunno. Just funny.
%
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: This one is different. He's ... or she's ... um ... hungry.
	Dispatcher: The bear is hungry. Are you serious?
%
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: This one doesn't look happy.
	Dispatcher: What exactly does a happy bear look like?

{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Can I wait here until the bear moves away?
- Sure, wait for the bear to move.
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Great. Thanks.
	Dispatcher: While you're waiting, brush up on your training for bear encounters.
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: Will do.
	do GlobalVars.skip_turn_wild_animal.emit()
- Proceed to that location. You've had your training - use it.
	{{GlobalVars.agent_name[GlobalVars.player_focus]}}: [[I understand.|Right, got it.]] Here I go.
	do GlobalVars.no_skip_turn_wild_animal.emit()
=> END

~ misbehavior_arthur
Dispatcher: Arthur, did you get your assignment?
Arthur: [wave]Splash ... Splash[/wave]
Dispatcher: Arthur, please respond.
Arthur: [wave]Splash ... Splash[/wave]
Dispatcher: Arthur!
Arthur: Oh, um ... hang on ... Yes. Yes, I'm here. ... Hi!
Dispatcher: You were asked to move to a new location. What were you doing?
Arthur: Nothing. ... Well, I was, um ... going for a quick swim. I saw the water and couldn't resist.
Dispatcher: You were going for a swim? Are you serious?
Arthur: No. ... I mean, yes.
Dispatcher: That's private property. Wait, did you actually bring a bathing suit with you? Never mind; I don't want to know.
Arthur: Uh, some things are better left unsaid.
Dispatcher: Wow. Okay, dry off and wait for your next assignment. And don't let this happen again.
Arthur: Yes, sir.
=> END

~ misbehavior_arthur_2
Dispatcher: Arthur, did you get your assignment?
Arthur: [wave]Splash ... Splash[/wave]
Dispatcher: No. No. Don't tell me. [shake freq=20.0 amp=5.0]Arthur![/shake]
Arthur: Yes. Hang on. ... Um ... Hi!
Dispatcher: Enough! Get changed and be ready next time!
Arthur: Okay. Sorry.
=> END

~ misbehavior_bertha
%
	Dispatcher: Bertha, where are you going? You were asked to move to loation {{GlobalVars.original_location_name}}
	Bertha: I got a good feeling about this!
	Dispatcher: No one asked for your feelings. Going forward, follow your orders.
	Bertha: Yes, sir.
%
	Bertha: Wait, I'm getting something ... [wave]mmmmmmmmm[/wave] ... I got it!
	Dispatcher: Bertha, your objective is to move to {{GlobalVars.original_location_name}}. Where are you going?
	Bertha: The universe is telling me to go to location {{GlobalVars.agent_location[1]}}!
	Dispatcher: You're not paid to listen to the universe. Next time, please follow your instructions.
	Bertha: Okay.
=> END

